{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"BandicamCompany.Bandicut","latestVersion":"4.2.8.2572","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.f657f3e1.png","priority":1,"sha256":"f657f3e18feb410d8ea893d73fae5cefa2331f03b9c80aad98c811c9143cfe9b","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Bandicut is a super fast video-cutting and joining software with an easy-to-use interface.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/company/tos/","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Bandicut is a super fast video-cutting and joining software with an easy-to-use interface.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/company/tos/","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Bandicut is a video editor that can cut specific parts of a video or join multiple videos together. Because it cuts videos without the need to re-encode, you can clip a part of a video quickly while maintaining the quality of the original video.\n\nFeatures\n- You can cut parts from the original copy without re-encoding.\n- [High-Speed Mode] does not decrease the quality.\n- You can precisely cut videos by frame.\n- You can quickly join more than 2 different video files.\n- You can change the playback speed.\n- Various compression codecs (H264, Xvid, MPEG-1, Motion JPEG, VP8, VP9, etc.) are supported\n- High-speed video cutting is supported.\n- Easy to use.\n\nSupported Video Formats\n- Input video formats (extension): *.avi, *.mp4, *.mov, *.m4v, *.mkv, *.webm, *.mpeg, *.mpg, *.dat, *.vob, *.flv, *.asf, *.wmv, *.ts, *.tp, *.trp, *.mpe, *.mpv2, *.mp2v, *.m2t, *.m2ts, *.k3g, *.divx, *.wm, *.wmx, *.wvx, *.rm, *.rmvb, *.ram, *.ivf, *.ogm, *.vp6, *.xvd\n- Output video formats (extension): MP4, AVI, MKV, WebM, MP3","moniker":"bandicut","name":"Bandicut","packageUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/bandicut-video-cutter/","publisher":"Bandicam.com","publisherUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/bandicut-video-cutter/history/","tags":["clip","creative","creativity","edit","editor","film","movie","video","video-editing","video-editor"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Bandicut 是一款极速的视频剪辑和合并软件，具有简单易用的界面。","license":"专有软件","licenseUrl":"https://www.bandicam.cn/company/tos/","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Bandicut 是一款视频编辑器，可以剪辑视频的特定部分或将多个视频合并在一起。由于它在剪辑视频时无需重新编码，您可以快速剪辑视频的一部分，同时保持原视频的质量。\n\n功能特点\n- 无需重新编码即可从原始视频中剪辑部分内容。\n- [高速模式] 不会降低视频质量。\n- 可以按帧精确剪辑视频。\n- 能够快速合并两个或多个不同的视频文件。\n- 可以调整视频播放速度。\n- 支持多种压缩编解码器（H264、Xvid、MPEG-1、Motion JPEG、VP8、VP9 等）。\n- 支持高速视频剪辑。\n- 操作简单易用。\n\n支持的视频格式\n- 输入视频格式（扩展名）：*.avi, *.mp4, *.mov, *.m4v, *.mkv, *.webm, *.mpeg, *.mpg, *.dat, *.vob, *.flv, *.asf, *.wmv, *.ts, *.tp, *.trp, *.mpe, *.mpv2, *.mp2v, *.m2t, *.m2ts, *.k3g, *.divx, *.wm, *.wmx, *.wvx, *.rm, *.rmvb, *.ram, *.ivf, *.ogm, *.vp6, *.xvd\n- 输出视频格式（扩展名）：MP4, AVI, MKV, WebM, MP3","packageUrl":"https://www.bandicam.cn/bandicut-video-cutter/","publisherUrl":"https://www.bandicam.cn/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.bandicam.cn/bandicut-video-cutter/history/","tags":["创意","剪辑","影片","电影","编辑","编辑器","视频","视频编辑","视频编辑器"]}},"longDescription":"Bandicut is a video editor that can cut specific parts of a video or join multiple videos together. Because it cuts videos without the need to re-encode, you can clip a part of a video quickly while maintaining the quality of the original video.\n\nFeatures\n- You can cut parts from the original copy without re-encoding.\n- [High-Speed Mode] does not decrease the quality.\n- You can precisely cut videos by frame.\n- You can quickly join more than 2 different video files.\n- You can change the playback speed.\n- Various compression codecs (H264, Xvid, MPEG-1, Motion JPEG, VP8, VP9, etc.) are supported\n- High-speed video cutting is supported.\n- Easy to use.\n\nSupported Video Formats\n- Input video formats (extension): *.avi, *.mp4, *.mov, *.m4v, *.mkv, *.webm, *.mpeg, *.mpg, *.dat, *.vob, *.flv, *.asf, *.wmv, *.ts, *.tp, *.trp, *.mpe, *.mpv2, *.mp2v, *.m2t, *.m2ts, *.k3g, *.divx, *.wm, *.wmx, *.wvx, *.rm, *.rmvb, *.ram, *.ivf, *.ogm, *.vp6, *.xvd\n- Output video formats (extension): MP4, AVI, MKV, WebM, MP3","moniker":"bandicut","name":"Bandicut","packageUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/bandicut-video-cutter/","publisher":"Bandicam.com","publisherUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.bandicam.com/bandicut-video-cutter/history/","tags":["clip","creative","creativity","edit","editor","film","movie","video","video-editing","video-editor"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/4.2.8.2572/app.json","detailSha256":"b49deb46fb855db16a100a8b67c29e0522adcbe2c7f6c901e3458a1e458925fd","releaseDate":"2026-10-30","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"4.2.8.2572"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/4.2.5.2562/app.json","detailSha256":"9d3bb8d370e37cc50914eed6ff8b18443c1cd070268e30529042b34b4a75a331","releaseDate":"2026-02-12","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"4.2.5.2562"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/4.2.4.2552/app.json","detailSha256":"b95eeea99a58eae5010a71a9b71d23c435c302a224114704d2d74e195a145c84","releaseDate":"2025-12-19","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"4.2.4.2552"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/4.2.2.2542/app.json","detailSha256":"4e802d413eb91382879c90ef7347f727223d1c19789a68bd63d4f7ae872dddf3","releaseDate":"2025-11-18","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"4.2.2.2542"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/4.2.1.2539/app.json","detailSha256":"15c6b516d15931f0cccf228817fcd622aa66c5a0ce1c97bb1f7b1801f9e72e7f","releaseDate":"2025-09-25","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"4.2.1.2539"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/4.1.0.2527/app.json","detailSha256":"17044e0104cf92677310eea6346b1c672bbac520b94ebde59f44db8abad405be","releaseDate":"2025-05-28","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"4.1.0.2527"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailP